\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Apparent velocity matrix plot of the Koenigsee dataset. Shot positions are plotted on the horizontal axis, geophone positions on the vertical axis. Color scale represents apparent velocity (m/s). The visualization reveals systematic velocity variations reflecting subsurface structure and heterogeneity.}}{4}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:apparent_velocity}{{2}{4}{Apparent velocity matrix plot of the Koenigsee dataset. Shot positions are plotted on the horizontal axis, geophone positions on the vertical axis. Color scale represents apparent velocity (m/s). The visualization reveals systematic velocity variations reflecting subsurface structure and heterogeneity}{figure.caption.3}{}}
